# A Final Unity, a new game on the ship (Plan 11): the census route from the bridge to the first beam-down, ids only.
# For tools/play only; Plan 13 diffs it against ScummVM.
seed 1
start ship
# the opening plays out on the bridge while the player waits (the original's tractor-beam scene, then the captain's orders):
# five conversation menus, each answered with its second option, which is the way that keeps the battle hail from coming,
# and a sixth: the first mission's hail (the census's t74 chain), met at the end of the wait. Its second option too
pick 1
pick 1
pick 1
pick 1
pick 1
pick 1
# (the battle hail comes all the same, a little before: battle 16, which the walk leaves at its start, at astrogation)
combat wait
station astrogation
# the first mission's planet: sector 156, star 3, planet 3 (the scripted warp's code 92076056)
plot 156 3 3
engage warp 300
# the transit, the arrival trigger t64, and the hails of its chain, which set the beam target
advance 450
station transporter
# the recommended team and kit, to the target (lab.s01, world 4)
beam
advance 5
end
